Rename the worksheet Sentiment Word Cloud.
Find Sentiment in the Data pane.
Drag Sentiment to Color on the Marks card.
Drag Sentiment to Size on the Marks card.
Drag Sentiment to Text on the Marks card.
Find Tweet Id in the Data pane.
Drag Tweet Id to Size, replacing the existing Sentiment pill on Size.
Click the Tweet Id pill dropdown and select Measure → Count.
Keep Sentiment on Color and Text.
Click Size and move the slider to the right to enlarge the words.
Adjust the view to Entire View if needed.
Set the worksheet title to Sentiment Word Cloud.
Check that frequent sentiment labels appear larger and different colors distinguish the sentiment categories.
